        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-05T16:04:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If anyone wants to get the painted miniatures and sell their unpainted miniatures to me (or trade them at a favorable basis for miniatures from the Reaper Bones kickstarters), I'd be happy to send actual money to people in exchange for a second set of unpainted miniatures to paint with a different color scheme. PM me. Please.</p>",
